<title>MEXICO: Mexico May steel production rises 8.4 pct on year.</title>
<headline>Mexico May steel production rises 8.4 pct on year.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's steel production rose 8.4 percent in May to 1.173 million tons compared to the same month a year earlier, the National Chamber of the Steel Industry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>From January to May accumlated production was 5.844 million tons, an 8.9 percent rise from the same period a year earlier, the Chamber said.</p>
<p>((--Monterrey newsroom +528 345 7617))</p>
